VALUES
 ('Safaricom Travel','safaricom-travel','Land connected','A Kenya data eSIM for travellers, with airport pickup and local support.','Kenya-wide 4G/5G coverage with a Kenyan number add-on.','From KES 1,500','https://www.safaricom.co.ke/','Get connected','Affiliate link; YTCI may earn a commission','marketplace/esim/safaricom-travel.jpg','Safaricom travel eSIM','published',true,10),
 ('Africa Roam','africa-roam','One eSIM, East Africa','Regional data for Kenya, Tanzania, Uganda and Rwanda.','Coverage across East Africa with a single plan and top-up.','From USD 9','https://www.airalo.com/','Compare plans','Affiliate link; YTCI may earn a commission','marketplace/esim/africa-roam.jpg','Africa Roam eSIM','published',false,20)
